  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。用心製作。適用於 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的大量活躍模組。\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">「全亮度切換」是一款客戶端模組，讓玩家只需按下一個按鍵，就能立即將亮度（伽瑪值）調至最高。預設按鍵為 G，但可以在「選項 -> 控制」中進行更改。此模組是基於一位視力障礙玩家的需求而創建，他希望有此功能以便順利遊玩。請勿在不允許的伺服器上使用。如有疑問，請先詢問。<br></span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"相依性\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/client-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含於 Serilum 的客戶端組合包中\" width=\"359\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/client.svg\" alt=\"環境：客戶端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p>功能展示：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/full-brightness-toggle/a.webp\" alt=\"gif0\" width=\"1000\" height=\"520\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>按鍵綁定可在遊戲內選項選單中更改：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/full-brightness-toggle/b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"579\"></strong></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載檔案仍託管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統中，您可以自由地在任何模組包中使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於無法在這麼多模組頁面中追蹤留言，因此已停用留言功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請至&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 儲存庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
